### ================================================================
### Hospital Server — Key operations
### FastAPI: http://localhost:8000  (docs at /docs)
###
### Focus: create episode + create note (the two mutations that drive
### outbox → HL7 flow). Simple GETs and trigger endpoints are better
### handled from /docs or directly via DB.
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Auth — capture token for all requests below
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Create Episode
###
### Triggers outbox: episode_created → A28 + A01 sent to central.
### - mrn:          OFFP prefix = offline patient (not yet in central)
### - num_episodio: OFFE prefix = offline episode
### - paciente:     "Apellido Nombre" — stored as "Apellido, Nombre"
### - tipo:         must match a value confirmed by central (synced_flag=true)
### - ubicacion:    must match a CTLOC code/description in central
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createEpisode
POST {{baseUrl}}/episodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mrn":             "OFFP{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
  "num_episodio":    "OFFE{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}",
  "run":             "12345678-9",
  "paciente":        "Soto Manuel",
  "sexo":            "M",
  "fecha_nacimiento":"1980-06-15T00:00:00",
  "tipo":            "Ambulatorio",
  "ubicacion":       "Consulta Telemedicina",
  "habitacion":      "Box 3",
  "estado":          "Activo",
  "motivo_consulta": "Dolor abdominal de 3 días de evolución",
  "profesional":     "doctest",
  "data_json": {}
}

###
@episodeId = {{createEpisode.response.body.id}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Create Clinical Note
###
### Triggers outbox: clinical_note_created → ORU^R01 sent to central.
### Replace {{episodeId}} with a real DB id if not chaining.
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createNote
POST {{baseUrl}}/episodes/{{episodeId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note_text": "Paciente refiere dolor abdominal difuso de 3 días. Afebril. Abdomen blando, doloroso a la palpación en FID. Se solicita hemograma y ecografía abdominal. Se indica analgesia y control en 24 h."
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Create Note on an existing episode (replace id manually)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/episodes/1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note_text": "Evolución: paciente en buenas condiciones generales. Hemodinámicamente estable. Se decide alta con indicaciones."
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Update episode (e.g. discharge)
### Only local — no upstream HL7 for updates (central ignores A08).
### ----------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{baseUrl}}/episodes/{{episodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado":    "Alta",
  "ubicacion": "Consulta Telemedicina"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Outbox / Sync — inspect and retry
### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### Current sync + connectivity status
GET {{baseUrl}}/sync/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry all failed outbox events
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/retry-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trigger upstream sync manually (flush outbox now)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
